  "speechText": "I would upload the file to object storage, then create a job that points to its location instead of processing it in the API request. A worker reads the file in chunks, saves progress, and updates a status the client can check. If the worker stops, it can resume from a checkpoint without repeating completed chunks. I set file size limits and make each step safe to retry so a bad file does not block the queue.",
